   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "widgets_values": [
    "### 6 · Ultimate SD Upscale ×1.9\n`OmniSR_X4_DIV2K` model upscale, then tiled re-sampling: **2 steps, euler/simple, denoise 0.1**\n(only sharpens; does not repaint). mask_blur 64, tile_padding 96, Linear mode.\n\nTiles ≈ (W·1.9 + 192)/2 → **1552×1920** for 1536×1920 (= 2×2 tiles). Change the tile size if you change the base resolution.\n\nAuthor also blends a `1xSkinContrast` upscale at 5 % — not available, skipped.\nOutput ≈ 2918×3648 — for the video still use the hi-res/face output instead."
   ]
